  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS - Southern Asia - Multicountry South Asia (01-Jan-2017-30-Sep-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry South Asia, HIV, Save the Children Federation, Inc. (STC HQ)This program has the following goals: To reduce the impact of HIV among MSM and TG populations in South Asia. The objectives of this program are: To improve strategic knowledge on MSM, TG, and HIV related issues in South Asia.  To improve the delivery of HIV related services for MSM and TG in South Asia.  To improve the policy environment with regards MSM, TG, and HIV related issues in South Asia</narrative>
  </description>
